<section class="wrap py-16" data-collision>
  <h2 class="display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)]">Drag a second booking onto a sold face</h2>
  <p class="section-copy mt-4">
    Accra Mall Face A is already held by an active contract. The second bar is the
    booking you are trying to sneak in. Arrow keys also move it.
  </p>

  <p class="mono mt-8 mb-2 text-sm">ACC-001 · Face A · 1 Aug – 31 Jan</p>
  <div
    class="track h-16"
    data-track
  >
    <div
      class="bar-occupied absolute top-3 h-10 w-[32%] px-3 py-2 text-sm"
      style="left: 36%"
      data-booked
    >
      Held
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute top-3 h-10 w-[22%] cursor-grab bg-[#f97316] px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#142f25]"
      data-draft
    >
      New booking
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="collision-error" data-error></p>
  <p class="section-copy mt-6">
    This is not a validation message. It is the database refusing.
  </p>
</section>
